@.str.200 = private unnamed_addr constant [760 x i8] c"Sweeps the triangle mesh rotationally about an axis.\0AArgs:\0A    angle (float): The rotation angle in degree.\0A    axis (open3d.core.Tensor): The rotation axis.\0A    resolution (int): The resolution defines the number of intermediate sweeps\0A        about the rotation axis.\0A    translation (float): The translation along the rotation axis.\0A\0AReturns:\0A    A triangle mesh with the result of the sweep operation.\0A\0AExample:\0A    This code generates a spring with a triangle cross-section::\0A\0A        import open3d as o3d\0A\0A        mesh = o3d.t.geometry.TriangleMesh([[1,1,0], [0.7,1,0], [1,0.7,0]], [[0,1,2]])\0A        spring = mesh.extrude_rotation(3*360, [0,1,0], resolution=3*16, translation=2)\0A        o3d.visualization.draw([{'name': 'spring', 'geometry': spring}])\0A\00", align 1
